#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:2
msgid "Focus Control Mode"
msgstr "フォーカスコントロールモード"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:4
msgid ""
":java:extdoc:`org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls.FocusControl.Mode`"
msgstr ""
":java:extdoc:`org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls.FocusControl.Mode`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:6
msgid ""
"A webcam may operate in one of various focus modes. To directly control the "
"focus length, set the webcam to Fixed mode."
msgstr ""
"ウェブカメラは、さまざまなフォーカスモードのいずれかで動作することがあります。フォーカスの長さを直接制御するには、ウェブカメラを固定モードに設定してください。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:9
msgid "The SDK supports these values of FocusControl.Mode:"
msgstr "SDKは、FocusControl.Modeのこれらの値をサポートしています："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:11
msgid "`Auto`"
msgstr "自動"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:12
msgid "`ContinuousAuto`"
msgstr "`ContinuousAuto`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:13
msgid "`Fixed`"
msgstr "修正済み"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:14
msgid "`Infinity`"
msgstr "`Infinity`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:15
msgid "`Macro`"
msgstr "マクロ"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:16
msgid "`Unknown`"
msgstr "不明"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:18
msgid "Mode is managed with these FocusControl methods:"
msgstr "モードはこれらのFocusControlメソッドで管理されます："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:20
msgid "setMode(ExposureControl.Mode._mode_)"
msgstr "setMode(ExposureControl.Mode._mode_)"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:21
msgid "getMode()"
msgstr "getMode()"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Logitech C920 webcam offers two modes: ContinuousAuto and Fixed, which "
"does respond to FocusControl methods. The Logitech C270 (older model) offers"
" only Fixed mode, but does not allow programmed control."
msgstr ""
"Logitech C920 ウェブカメラは、ContinuousAuto と Fixed の2つのモードを提供しており、FocusControl "
"メソッドに応答します。一方、Logitech C270（旧モデル）は Fixed モードのみを提供しており、プログラム制御は許可されていません。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/focus/mode/mode.rst:27
msgid ""
"Full details are described in the `FocusControl Javadoc "
"<https://javadoc.io/doc/org.firstinspires.ftc/RobotCore/latest/org/firstinspires/ftc/robotcore/external/hardware/camera/controls/FocusControl.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"詳細は `FocusControl Javadoc "
"<https://javadoc.io/doc/org.firstinspires.ftc/RobotCore/latest/org/firstinspires/ftc/robotcore/external/hardware/camera/controls/FocusControl.html>`__"
" に記載されています。"
